      "id": 15400,
      "title": "Georeferenced Event Dataset",
      "description": "This dataset is UCDP's most disaggregated dataset, covering individual events of organized violence (phenomena of lethal violence occurring at a given time and place). These events are sufficiently fine-grained to be geo-coded down to the level of individual villages, with temporal durations disaggregated to single, individual days.\n\nYou can find more notes at https://ucdp.uu.se/downloads/ged/ged261.pdf",
